    "Active radar buys precise range/range-rate measurements while revealing its direction to illuminated receivers.",
    "ECM is received interference power and ECCM is a processing/geometry/time trade rather than a percentage resistance.",
    "Decoys create competing measurement hypotheses; multi-band and multi-sensor consistency can reject simplistic decoys.",
